<title>UK: Waterschapsbank sets A$100 mln five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Waterschapsbank sets A$100 mln five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEDERLANDSE WATERSCHAPSBANK</p>
<p> AMT	  A$100 MLN COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    15.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.435   PAY DATE    14.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETHS     HOME CTRY  NETHS</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
